
# <type>(<scope>): <imperative summary, at most 72 characters>
#   type: feat | fix | docs | test | refactor | perf | build | ci | chore
#
# Why: the problem or motivation, in one or two sentences.
#
# What changed:
# - the main changes, one per line
#
# Testing: the commands you ran and their result, or "not run: <reason>".
#
# Refs: #issue or PR numbers.
#
# Co-Authored-By trailers are fine. Never add a Claude-Session line, any
# claude.ai link, or a "Generated with Claude Code" footer: CI rejects them.
# Enable once per clone:  git config commit.template .gitmessage
